                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>11</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月下旬的一天，当我们走进树仁大学的时候，正值中午放学时间，学生们从校园内鱼贯而出，或三三两两地有说有笑，或孑然一身戴着耳机听着潮炫的音乐，也不乏小情侣，搂腰勾肩地说着情话</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>……</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">宝马山，香港一座小山峰，因着这些时尚而朝气的学生，显得格外青翠葱茏充满生机。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">校监胡鸿烈先生，此刻正端坐在办公室的沙发里，目光温和。阳光透过拉了一层细纱的窗户打在他的脸上，柔和温顺。他的头发白了，但梳理得整整齐齐；他的眼睛失去光泽了，但仍然传送着温暖；他的额头爬满了细密的皱纹，像是鱼儿跃出水面后溅起的波痕，那是智慧的年轮。老人已近百岁。我们进去的时候，胡鸿烈努力地想弓起身来，被我们搀扶着制止了。老人歉意地笑了笑，和我们一一握手。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1920</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年出生在绍兴。巴黎大学法学博士、英国大律师，香港树仁大学校监。　　他是当年绍兴一中的学霸</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">按现在的说法，胡鸿烈是一名学霸，而且是一名调皮的学霸。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈自幼家贫，到</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">岁才读小学，但他只用了短短两年半时间，就完成了一般人要</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年才能完成的小学课程。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1935</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月，胡鸿烈在众多考生中脱颖而出，以第一名的成绩考进浙江省立绍兴中学，也就是今天的绍兴一中。不过谁都不知道的是，考试的前一天，胡鸿烈还跟同学打了一架，头破血流地回到家温习了一晚上的功课。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">说到这段往事的时候，胡鸿烈依然不乏有些小得意，虽然已经记不太清楚当天到底是</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">为了什么而战</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，但时隔</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>80</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">战场</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">虽荒芜，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">战果</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">却依然有迹可循</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>——</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">他的额头上至今还留有一道淡淡的疤痕。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">他参加省升中试，在浙江省</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">万多名考生中高中状元。毕业后顺利进入顶级学府之一的</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">中央政治大学</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，主修法律，并于</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1942</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年毕业。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1944</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，胡鸿烈参加全国高等文官考试，再次才情爆发，在外交官组位居榜首。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">同期考试的司法组状元是位女孩子，名叫钟期荣，来自湖南长沙，国立武汉大学法律系毕业，后来成为中国首位女法官。根据安排，钟期荣为这批新外交官进行司法训练，这两位状元就这样看对了眼，居然谈起恋爱来。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">翌年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>11</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>12</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">日，胡鸿烈和钟期荣在重庆结婚。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1949</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，夫妻俩一起漂洋过海，留学于法国巴黎大学，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1952</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年胡鸿烈获巴黎大学法学博士学位，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1955</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年定居香港任执业大律师。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">在香港，律师和大律师其实是两种不同的职业</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>——</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">出庭的叫大律师，不出庭的是事务律师。胡鸿烈说，当时大部分修法律的学生都会选择当事务律师，因为市场需求大，钱也比大律师赚得多。不过，当时要做事务律师就必须放弃中国国籍，胡鸿烈为保留中国国籍而选择了当大律师。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">回港后的胡鸿烈平步青云，在上世纪</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>50</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年代的香港，他已经是具有相当知名度的人物，当时香港只有</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>10</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">名大律师，他是其中之一，他是最早期的民选立法局议员。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1979</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，胡鸿烈受邀回大陆，出席国庆三十周年纪念活动，并获邓小平接见。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">他与夫人的事迹感动中国</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“2007</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年感动中国的奖状还在不在？</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">我问胡鸿烈先生。这是我了解到的他们夫妻俩得到过的最有含金量的荣誉。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">在小姐的办公室里。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈一时没有反应过来，他的工作人员就代为作答了。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">工作人员带我走进了隔壁的办公室。这里被收拾得整整齐齐，除了阳光的味道，看不到一丝尘埃。室内堆满了各类书籍和奖杯奖状，墙上的锦旗也静静地沐浴着阳光</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>……</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">这一切都无声地宣告着，这里的主人是一位获奖无数的读书人！</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">这里是树仁大学的校长室，它的主人就是胡鸿烈的妻子钟期荣。自从</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2014</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>11</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月钟期荣病逝后，这里一直保留着她生前的模样。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">与胡鸿烈同期回港后，钟期荣先后在香港的多所院校任教。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1971</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，钟期荣辞去教职。当时，他们在跑马地成和道买下了一幢花园洋楼。喜欢孩子的钟期荣想利用这个场地办一所幼稚园以怡情寄兴。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">可是夫妻俩很快就看到了一个问题：上世纪七十年代初，香港经济起飞，但港英政府对教育的投入依然十分不足，中学学位短缺，大学的境遇也好不到哪儿去，每年有机会考进大学的寥寥无几。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈夫妻经过反复的考虑和讨论，决定拿出全部的</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>70</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">万元积蓄，办一所大专学校。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltag1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1971</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>7</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">树仁学院</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">正式挂牌。校训是</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">敦仁博物</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">我问胡鸿烈，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">敦仁博物</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">四个字该怎么理解？胡鸿烈说</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">敦仁</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">是指做人的态度要积极，要学会帮助人家；</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">博物</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">是指做学问不能马虎。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1978</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">树仁学院</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">搬迁至宝马山。按照政府的规划，这里只能兴建几层校舍，胡鸿烈却坚持打</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>176</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">条桩，最终建成</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>12</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">层大楼；为了建成图书馆大楼，胡鸿烈想方设法筹募上亿元；为了让学生享有宿舍楼生活，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2002</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年兴建学生宿舍和文康大楼，胡鸿烈更不惜以迟暮之年，回律师楼工作，出入法庭打官司，为大楼挣工程费。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈夫妇对教育的奉献，得到了政府及各界人士的一致认同。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2006</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>12</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>19</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">日，香港树仁学院获批准升格为大学，成为香港首所私立大学。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">但这</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>35</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年的历程走得并不轻松。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">树仁</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">从一开始就坚持四年制，不要政府津贴，所有的投入都是靠胡鸿烈律师楼的收入。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 25.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2007</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，美籍天文学家杨光宇将两颗于</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2001</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年首次被发现的小行星</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“34778”“34779”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">命名为</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈星</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">和</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">钟期荣星</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">同年，胡鸿烈夫妇当选为</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“2007</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">感动中国年度人物</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，与科学老人钱学森一起站上了领奖台。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">组委会授予他们的颁奖词是：狮子山下的愚公，香江边上的夫子。贤者伉俪，本可锦衣玉食，却偏偏散尽家产，一生奔波。为了学生，甘为骆驼。与人有益，牛马也做。我们相信教育能改变社会，而他们是教育的楷模。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">母校是他一生</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">践行仁义的源泉</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">明年，您的母校</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>——</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">绍兴一中将迎来</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>120</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">周年校庆，您有什么话想对母校说吗？</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">我问。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltag1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">胡鸿烈陷入了沉思。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">良久，老人缓缓地抬起头，一字一句地说：</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">没有母校，就没有我的一切！</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">老人此话一出，让在场所有的人都肃然了。谁也没有想到，对于母校，老人居然怀有这样的感恩之情。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">其实，老人对母校的感情还是有迹可循的。我曾经读过他的一篇回忆文章，老人写道：　　</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">在这片并不广袤的土地上，在这个略显局促的校园里，一位位名声响彻寰宇的仁人志士践行着他们爱国为民的理想。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>‘</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">学界泰斗</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>’</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">蔡元培，力挫守旧势力，改革教育，慧眼识才，大胆用人，冲破旧式书院万马齐喑的沉闷空气，为绍兴一中的发展开创了一个大胆革新、勇于追求的风貌。近代中国的民族脊梁</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>——</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">鲁迅先生，举斧凿，开越学，在他担任绍兴一中监学时，以充实师资队伍为途径中兴教育，驰书邀来许寿裳共同开拓这项育人事业。当这一页页的历史被翻开的时候，有一个声音在我的心中不断回荡，召引着我一生的作为。那就是作为一个渴望报效祖国的知识分子，可以且应该担负起的使命</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>——</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">树人。我想，我的血液里，也早已流淌了如他们那般的激情。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">现在，我们不难理解，为什么老人要把自己的学校命名为</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">树仁</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">了。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">　　绍兴一中的朱雯校长恭敬地递上一份《校庆邀请函》，邀请老人在明年</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>10</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">月那个金桂飘香的季节里，回到母校看一看。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">老人读完邀请函，桀然一笑：</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">明年，我是肯定不在了的。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">朱雯顿时泪花泛滥，她用带着哭腔的声音重复着：</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">不会的，不会的，一定不会的。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>”<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">　　而老人却依然笑得云淡风轻。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'">也许，这一刻老人的心早已奔向母校了。故乡，只一念想，就捂暖了这一世孤寂的时光。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
